# Issue #6 bench run on the Pi 5, 2026-11-12. Branch issue-6-gwmon-v1 at 41490ca.
# The card holds the image flashed for issue #4 (a611da7) plus /usr/bin/gwmon and /etc/init.d/S99gwmon from this
# branch's Buildroot build, copied over SSH. SHA-256 on the Pi and inside the new rootfs.ext2:
#   5f937cca088017c58206779748607fd21062eff8e0d2f02f96edf0bf422a8569  /usr/bin/gwmon
#   e9c7dd7e7f06002127f01148d1a1c3c50a6ce9fe4a97622880723c1f1da8d362  /etc/init.d/S99gwmon
# Lines starting with $ are the commands, run over SSH as root unless marked PC. 192.168.0.103 is the Pi.

